  "body": "The function `getRssiInst()` is used for the LR11x0 to get an instantaneous RSSI measurement, but it is protected. This exposes it by overloading `getRSSI()` with the `bool packet` parameter added just like is done for SX127x, SX126x, SX128x and LR2021.\r\n\r\nI also rephrased *Recorded* Signal Strength Indicator to *Received* Signal Strength Indicator as I believe that's the more common term.",
